><highlight color="#9643FC" opacity="0.399994" creationdate="D:20250522101718+10'00'" flags="print" IT="HighlightNote" date="D:20250522101720+10'00'" name="5907ab0d-3fa5-48b9-a22d-44fa852a772f" page="5" coords="318.049072,549.565430,557.231445,549.565430,318.049072,539.770142,557.231445,539.770142,306.086609,539.077454,557.126038,539.077454,306.086609,529.282166,557.126038,529.282166,306.086609,528.646057,557.121216,528.646057,306.086609,518.850769,557.121216,518.850769,306.086609,518.158081,557.288696,518.158081,306.086609,508.362793,557.288696,508.362793,306.086609,507.726685,557.135010,507.726685,306.086609,497.931396,557.135010,497.931396,306.086609,497.238708,557.173645,497.238708,306.086609,487.443420,557.173645,487.443420,306.086609,486.807312,557.178528,486.807312,306.086609,477.012024,557.178528,477.012024,306.086609,476.319336,452.672546,476.319336,306.086609,466.524048,452.672546,466.524048" rect="305.780518,466.217957,557.594788,549.871521" subject="Comment on Text" title="Alexander Gibson"
><contents-richtext
><body xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:APIVersion="Acrobat:25.1.0" xfa:spec="2.0.2"
><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14c: </span
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-10.7pt;text-align:left;color:#000000;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>This study supports the need to increase our understanding of athlete&#xD;attrition in individual sporting contexts by acknowledging the&#xD;large variation in perspectives across an Australian high-performance&#xD;pathway system. This study also reinforces the importance of including&#xD;the athletes' voices and ensuring diverse representation in leadership&#xD;and decision-making, to create a gender-appropriate and holistically&#xD;tailored environment that can help to retain talented athletes in our&#xD;high-performance pathway programmes.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="5" rect="595.276001,457.565430,779.276001,549.565430"
/></highlight
